**filesystem.hpp does declare filesystem search-path and file-access APIs.**

## API

`read_file(const std::string&) -> std::string`; overload `read_file(const std::string&, std::string*, std::string*=nullptr) -> bool`; `find_file`, `exists`; path registration and search-path toggles.